title: Tortellini Skewers
author: J Scholfield
course: Appetizer
method: stovetop
source: https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/247347/tortellini-skewers/
cuisine: American
protein: none
servings: 12
cook time: 10 minutes
prep time: 15 minutes
time required: 25 minutes
ingredient_count: 3
---

Fill a #large pot{} with lightly salted water and bring to a rolling boil; stir in @refrigerated tortellini{1%20 ounce package} and return to a boil. Cook uncovered, stirring occasionally, until tortellini float to the top, ~{5-6%minutes}. Drain and rinse with cold water.

Toss tortellini, @cherry tomatoes{2%pints}, and @pesto{0.5%cup} together in a #large bowl{} until evenly coated.

Skewer 1 tortellini and 1 tomato on each @toothpicks{}; arrange on a #tray{}. Keep refrigerated until serving.